        <div class="doc-card">
          <h3 class="doc-card__t">Natural Marble</h3>
          <p class="doc-card__d">Cut from genuine marble and natural stone, each marble tessera carries the depth, veining, and character of the earth it came from. Honed or polished by hand, marble brings timeless warmth and a tactile, sculptural quality. Natural color and texture variation is inherent to the stone — it's what makes every piece unique.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="doc-card">
          <h3 class="doc-card__t">Hand-Cut Glass</h3>
          <p class="doc-card__d">Our glass tesserae are hand-cut from vitreous glass in a full spectrum of jewel-like tones, including luminous iridescent finishes that catch the light. Glass is non-porous, waterproof, and color-stable, making it ideal for vivid detail, pools, fountains, and any space where brilliance and moisture resistance matter.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="doc-sec">
      <div class="doc-sec__eyebrow">Built to Last</div>
      <h2 class="doc-sec__title">Performance &amp; Durability</h2>
      <p class="doc-sec__p"><strong>Waterproof.</strong> Made from non-porous, waterproof materials, our mosaics are suited to swimming pools, fountains, bathrooms, showers, and kitchen backsplashes — retaining their color and integrity even with constant water exposure.</p>
      <p class="doc-sec__p"><strong>Weatherproof.</strong> Crafted from natural marble, stone, and glass, every mosaic withstands sun, frost, heat, and humidity without fading or cracking — ideal for patios, façades, garden walls, and outdoor spaces.</p>
      <p class="doc-sec__p"><strong>Slip-tested.</strong> Every mosaic undergoes a slip test before shipping to ensure it is safe for floors, pool surrounds, bathrooms, and other walk-on areas.</p>
      <p class="doc-sec__p"><strong>Backed for life.</strong> We provide a lifetime warranty on all our mosaics, so your investment stays as beautiful as the day it was installed.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="doc-sec">
      <div class="doc-sec__eyebrow">How It Ships</div>
      <h2 class="doc-sec__title">Format, Backing &amp; Delivery</h2>
      <p class="doc-sec__p">Each mosaic is carefully glued to a <strong>fiber-mesh backing</strong> that secures the hand-cut tiles together into easy-to-install sheets, then packaged with thick paper and heavy-duty polyester film for safe transport.</p>
      <p class="doc-sec__p">Mosaics up to <strong>10 sq. ft.</strong> are delivered in one piece, rolled like a carpet. Larger mosaics are split into smaller, clearly <strong>numbered sections</strong> for easy assembly on site — just like a puzzle.</p>
    </div>

